SaffronCity_Text_WhatDoYouWantGetLost::
    .string "What do you want?\n"
    .string "Get lost!$"

SaffronCity_Text_BossTakeTownForTeamRocket::
    .string "BOSS said he'll take this town\n"
    .string "in the name of TEAM ROCKET!$"

SaffronCity_Text_DontGetDefiantOrIllHurtYou::
    .string "Don't get defiant!\n"
    .string "Or I'll have to hurt you!$"

SaffronCity_Text_SaffronBelongsToTeamRocket::
    .string "SAFFRON belongs to TEAM ROCKET!$"

SaffronCity_Text_CriminalLifeMakesMeFeelAlive::
    .string "My life as a criminal makes me feel\n"
    .string "so alive!$"

SaffronCity_Text_WatchWhereYoureWalking::
    .string "Ow!\n"
    .string "Watch where you're walking!$"

SaffronCity_Text_WeCanExploitMonsAroundWorld::
    .string "With SILPH under control, we can\n"
    .string "exploit POKéMON around the world!\p"
    .string "We'll get stinking rich, yeahah!$"

SaffronCity_Text_YouBeatTeamRocket::
    .string "You beat Team Rocket\n"
    .string "alone?\n"
    .string "That's amazing.\p"
    .string "Something else has\n"
    .string "been in this city\n"
    .string "that nobody beat.\p"
    .string "Nobody tried.\p"
    .string "Chronyx doesn't\n"
    .string "respond to battle.$"

SaffronCity_Text_SafeToGoOutAgain::
    .string "Yeah!\n"
    .string "Team Rocket is gone!\n"
    .string "Safe to go out.\p"
    .string "Time felt wrong\n"
    .string "during the occupation.\p"
    .string "Clocks ran differently\n"
    .string "in different buildings.\p"
    .string "Chronyx was here\n"
    .string "before Team Rocket.$"

SaffronCity_Text_PeopleComingBackToSaffron::
    .string "People fled when\n"
    .string "Rockets came.\p"
    .string "They should flock\n"
    .string "back to Saffron now.\p"
    .string "Some who came\n"
    .string "back say hours\n"
    .string "are missing.\p"
    .string "They don't know\n"
    .string "where the time went.$"

SaffronCity_Text_FlewHereOnPidgeot::
    .string "I flew here\n"
    .string "on my Pidgeot\n"
    .string "when I read\n"
    .string "about Silph Durith.\p"
    .string "Already over?\n"
    .string "I missed everything.\p"
    .string "My Pidgeot says\n"
    .string "we flew for\n"
    .string "three hours.\p"
    .string "My watch says\n"
    .string "we left five\n"
    .string "minutes ago.$"

SaffronCity_Text_Pidgeot::
    .string "PIDGEOT: Bi bibii!\p"
    .string "PIDGEOT looks confused.$"

SaffronCity_Text_SawRocketBossEscaping::
    .string "I saw the\n"
    .string "Rocket Boss escaping\n"
    .string "Silph Durith's building.\p"
    .string "He ran fast.\p"
    .string "But he looked\n"
    .string "old when he\n"
    .string "came out.\p"
    .string "Older than when\n"
    .string "he went in.\p"
    .string "Chronyx was on\n"
    .string "that floor.$"

SaffronCity_Text_ImASecurityGuard::
    .string "I'm a security guard.\p"
    .string "Suspicious kids I don't allow in!$"

SaffronCity_Text_HesTakingASnooze::
    .string "…\n"
    .string "Snore…\p"
    .string "Hah! He's taking a snooze!$"

SaffronCity_Text_CitySign::
    .string "GOLDMUR\n"
    .string "Shining Golden Land\n"
    .string "of Commerce\p"
    .string "Time moves differently\n"
    .string "here now.\n"
    .string "Since Chronyx arrived.$"

SaffronCity_Text_FightingDojo::
    .string "FIGHTING DOJO\p"
    .string "The fighters here\n"
    .string "train every day.\p"
    .string "Some days repeat.\p"
    .string "They don't notice yet.$"

SaffronCity_Text_GymSign::
    .string "GOLDMUR POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: SABRINA\l"
    .string "The Master of PSYCHIC POKéMON!$"

SaffronCity_Text_FullHealCuresStatus::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\n"
    .string "FULL HEAL cures\n"
    .string "all ailments.\p"
    .string "Nothing cures what\n"
    .string "Chronyx leaves behind.$"

SaffronCity_Text_GreatBallImprovedCatchRate::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\n"
    .string "GREAT BALL offers\n"
    .string "improved catching rates.\p"
    .string "Chronyx cannot be caught.\p"
    .string "Time cannot be caught.$"

SaffronCity_Text_SilphCoSign::
    .string "SILPH DURITH\n"
    .string "OFFICE BUILDING\p"
    .string "Something still on\n"
    .string "the upper floors.\p"
    .string "Not Team Rocket.$"

SaffronCity_Text_MrPsychicsHouse::
    .string "MR. PSYCHIC'S HOUSE$"

SaffronCity_Text_SilphsLatestProduct::
    .string "SILPH's latest product.\n"
    .string "Release undetermined.\p"
    .string "The researchers on\n"
    .string "floor 9 stopped\n"
    .string "aging three weeks ago.\p"
    .string "That wasn't the product.$"

SaffronCity_Text_TrainerFanClubSign::
    .string "POKEMON TRAINER\n"
    .string "FAN CLUB\p"
    .string "Many Trainers scribbled\n"
    .string "names on this sign.\p"
    .string "Four names were\n"
    .string "already here.\n"
    .string "Very old ink.$"

SaffronCity_Text_HowCanClubNotRecognizeLance::
    .string "This FAN CLUB…\n"
    .string "No one here has a clue!\p"
    .string "How could they not recognize\n"
    .string "the brilliance that is LANCE?\p"
    .string "He stands for justice!\n"
    .string "He's cool, and yet passionate!\l"
    .string "He's the greatest, LANCE!$"
